A student writes this queue class. Identify the bug and explain why it violates FIFO:
```python
class Queue:
    def __init__(self):
        self.items = []
    def enqueue(self, item):
        self.items.insert(0, item)  # Bug here
    def dequeue(self):
        if self.is_empty():
            return None
        return self.items.pop()
```
